  "disclosures": [
    "ATM-F1R2 is the A1 frozen F1R2/F2R2 injection set; it is not the ISO standard atmosphere. M2.02/18,288 m is exactly continuous with F1R2; 2.2/1.8 are new conditions and do not inherit F1R2 expected polars.",
    "The old F1 543x472 geometry 40fdd436 is retired from the task family; 543x472 remains historical evidence only. 199,997 B / 483x418 is a different case (58f63bfc, P1-05), not 40fdd436.",
    "The post-fix baseline vspgeom 16da482a is byte-identical across two independent zero-physics builds and equals the frozen F1R bundle PRE-01R geometry.",
    "Dry-run builds are real OpenVSP in-process builds with VSPAEROComputeGeometry only (StopBeforeRun=1). No vspaero.exe solver process is spawned; 27 tests and the dry-run both report solver_started=false and spawn_events=[].",
    "Sref(x) is recomputed per design; C5 uses 370.25 m2 and must not be normalized to 358.25.",
    "Same-Mach tasks with different CL_target have byte-identical .vspaero decks because CL_target is an evaluation target, not a solver input; each task still has an independent case dir and task_deck.json.",
    "F1R2/F2R2 run directories and package bytes were not modified.",
    "R07 C01-C04 cross constraints are enforced by the M1 sampler/executor (A3 package + A2 runner), not by this A1 interface."
  ],
